      ":question/problem": "The graph of $y =-f(2x) + 4$, can be obtained from the graph of $y = f(x)$ by applying **some** of the following transformations:\n\n- $(T1)$ - Translation by $4$ units up\n- $(T2)$ - Reflection across the $x$-axis\n- $(T3)$ - Translation by $4$ units down\n- $(T4)$ - Stretch of scale factor $\\frac{1}{2}$ parallel to the $x$-axis\n\nWhich of the following could be a possible ordering of the appropriate transformations?"
